epingComputer","sourceUrl","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/cursor-confirms-security-breach-led-to-malicious-claude-code-extension/","publishedAt","2026-11-14T17:27:25.000Z","sourceIconUrl","/dailyinfo/media/198a4d86de90e233.webp","sourceIconSrcSet","/dailyinfo/media/3a544a742516b0af.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/198a4d86de90e233.webp 96w","firstParty",false,"available",true,"mo0o847hgkw4mbxcp3hicc7jh","Expedia 遭供应链攻击，n0n 声称窃取近 10 亿条旅客记录","Expedia 确认攻击者入侵受感染的第三方数据平台供应商，并借其可信权限进入多家公司系统，调查仍在进行且未证实 n0n 声称的数据规模。","Security Affairs","https://securityaffairs.com/203062/cyber-crime/extortion-group-claims-theft-of-nearly-one-billion-expedia-traveler-records.html","2026-11-14T16:46:26.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/ef2b2b57fb06e54f.webp","/dailyinfo/media/2adef5b1e4357a03.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/ef2b2b57fb06e54f.webp 96w","q62rs7r8pongzx30vtu5q3hx7","美国政府中断 North Korean FaceStealer 活动，查获超 4 亿美元加密资产盗取","美国政府查获基础设施并中断 North Korean 社会工程活动 FaceStealer，该活动持续 18 个月，针对加密货币、Web3 行业及开源开发者，盗取超过 $400 million 加密资产。","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/us-disrupts-north-korean-campaign-behind-400-million-crypto-theft/","2026-11-14T15:15:49.000Z","漏洞与在野利用",[192],{"_159":130,"_52":95,"_153":193,"_163":180,"_165":194,"_167":195,"_169":183,"_171":184,"_173":174,"_175":176},"CISA 将 UnrealIRCd 命令注入漏洞 CVE-2026-114713 和 Check Point 本地提权漏洞 CVE-2026-123039 加入 KEV 目录，确认均已被真实利用，并要求联邦机构在 2026 年 11 月 16 日前完成处置。","https://securityaffairs.com/203040/hacking/u-s-cisa-adds-check-point-and-unrealircd-flaws-to-its-known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog.html","2026-11-14T09:08:00.000Z",{"_159":185,"_52":186,"_153":187,"_163":164,"_165":188,"_167":189,"_169":170,"_171":172,"_173":174,"_175":176},{"_159":177,"_52":178,"_153":179,"_163":180,"_165":181,"_167":182,"_169":183,"_171":184,"_173":174,"_175":176},{"_159":160,"_52":161,"_153":162,"_163":164,"_165":166,"_167":168,"_169":170,"_171":172,"_173":174,"_175":176},"leadParagraph",{"_201":202,"_203":-5},"changelogVersion","2026-10-01T08:00"